# About 40 Outputs

Things you made for use outside the vault (`type: output`): documents, drafts, reports, decks, posts. An output is the end of a chain rather than a link in it — it records what knowledge and evidence it was built from, which is what lets you trace any deliverable back to its grounds, and lets the system tell you which deliverables are affected when something upstream changes. Like the knowledge folder, this one is organised by metadata and links rather than by filing.
